  "description": {
    "en": "MSV Focus Hex is the brand's bestselling hexagonal co-polyester string, engineered for maximum spin potential, excellent control and high tension stability. With more than two million units sold, it has become one of MSV's signature performance strings for fast-swinging tournament and club players. Its five available gauges range from the ultra-thin 1.10 mm version for maximum spin and feel to the 1.33 mm version for maximum durability and stability.",

    "zh": "MSV Focus Hex 是 MSV 最畅销的六边形共聚酯球线，核心特点是极高的旋转潜力、优秀控制力以及良好的保磅表现，累计销量超过 200 万条。它非常适合挥拍速度快的比赛型和俱乐部球员。产品提供 1.10、1.18、1.23、1.27 与 1.33 毫米五种线径，从极细线径的极致旋转与手感，到粗线径的高耐久与稳定性，覆盖范围非常完整。"
  },

